        {
          "text": "Imana ibonana na we, maze Balamu aravuga ati: “Nateguye ibicaniro indwi, kandi natangiye ku gicaniro cose impfizi y’inka n’iy’intama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.4",
